  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greening humanitarian responses through enhanced Solar Energy harvesting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will be testing the viability of harnessing excess energy produced by solar pumps for other uses e.g. mobile phone charging, lighting, agricultural equipment, radios, sewing machines etc. It seeks to provide proof of concept and lessons for larger pilots and eventual scale up.</narrative>
